  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6008.01 Engineering Plan Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6008.01 Engineering Plan Review. Any of the following entities or projects requiring review of engineering plans by the state fire marshal’s office for compliance with the state fire code or the state building code, or both, shall request such review by completing and submitting form DSFS 107, “Plan Review Submission Request” (eff 7/20, rev. 5/26):\n\n(a) Publicly-funded school facilities per Ed 321.13;\n\n(b) School building aid projects per Ed 321.23(t); and\n\n(c) Healthcare facilities per RSA 151:6, IV.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 6000) #13094, eff 8-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6000.html"
}
